  "name": "Health above 80% aura state (28): First Blood and Pure Light",
  "contract": "AuraStateType 28 is set while a living unit is above 80% health and cleared otherwise. First Blood (560906; Spell.dbc aura 303, MiscValue 28, 19+1 = 20%; tooltip 'Increases all damage dealt to enemies above 80% health by $s1%') adds 20% only against players and creatures above 80% health. Pure Light (301341; CasterAuraState 28, aura 79 9+1 = 10%; tooltip 'While above 80% health you now deal $s1% increased damage and healing') is active only while its owner is above 80% health, stays applied while suspended and resumes once. The Sun Cleric Pure Light talent (300314) keeps its helper only while the state is set. Damage metrics query native outgoing calculations relative to identical controls.",
